    "detailed_description": "After 20 years of eating nothing but porridge, Hank decides to collect ingredients for a nice tasty soup.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA simple side-scroller where the goal of each stage is to pick up the soup ingredient at the end.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCurrently features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 3 soups to collect ingredients for, each with a unique set of levels, including:<br />\r\n -Leek &amp; Potato soup, set in Onion Forest, teeming with curious wildlife <br />\r\n -Lobster Bisque, set in Crab Coast, where soft sands border a shimmering ocean<br />\r\n -Pumpkin soup, set in Pumpkin Hollow, a dark haunted valley where few dare to venture<br />\r\n\u2022 8 challenges to complete per soup<br />\r\n\u2022 Unlockable game modes including time trial mode<br />\r\n\u2022 Controller support- tested with XBox One controller but should work for others too<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreated entirely by me, Sean T.",
